28
00:02:02,250 --> 00:02:03,625
Apa itu terdengar masuk akal?

29
00:02:09,125 --> 00:02:11,000
Terdengar seperti alarm perimeter.

30
00:02:11,125 --> 00:02:13,000
Akan kupastikan.

31
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:17,750
- Kontak terputus.
- Periksa itu.

32
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:22,250
Tidak ada yang perlu dikhawatirkan.

33
00:02:22,375 --> 00:02:24,625
Aku akan mengirim bala bantuan.

34
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,875
Aku butuh proyeksi pendapatan...

35
00:02:53,625 --> 00:02:55,625
