57
00:08:02,625 --> 00:08:03,875
Dia ada di atap!

58
00:08:04,625 --> 00:08:05,625
<i>Apa kau melihatnya?</i>

59
00:08:06,250 --> 00:08:07,250
<i>Habisi dia!</i>

60
00:08:07,375 --> 00:08:08,375
Naik ke sana.

61
00:08:09,125 --> 00:08:10,250
Tapi kami pilot.

62
00:08:10,375 --> 00:08:13,000
- Pergi sekarang! Lakukan!
- Baik, Tuan. Kami meluncur.

63
00:08:13,125 --> 00:08:14,500
Naik ke sana.

64
