93
00:13:34,375 --> 00:13:36,125
Aku sudah mencobanya.

94
00:13:36,625 --> 00:13:38,625
Mereka melakukan pekerjaan bagus.

95
00:13:41,250 --> 00:13:43,000
Ini jauh lebih berharga daripada

96
00:13:43,125 --> 00:13:44,625
