114
00:14:25,875 --> 00:14:27,500
Namanya Rotta the Hutt.

115
00:14:27,625 --> 00:14:31,000
Satu-satunya ahli waris Jabba the Hutt.

116
00:14:31,625 --> 00:14:32,875
Pernah berurusan dengannya?

117
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:34,625
Aku berusaha menghindarinya.

118
00:14:35,750 --> 00:14:36,750
Jadi...

119
00:14:37,625 --> 00:14:38,750
