Hei.

134
00:16:07,375 --> 00:16:08,500
Jangan sentuh apa pun.

135
00:16:09,125 --> 00:16:10,375
Jangan pernah sentuh tombolnya.

136
00:17:54,125 --> 00:17:56,125
