142
00:18:12,500 --> 00:18:13,875
<i>Kau diizinkan mendekat.</i>

143
00:18:14,625 --> 00:18:16,750
Mereka punya banyak senjata di sini.

144
00:18:16,750 --> 00:18:19,875
Ya. Sepertinya mereka menyewa Droid Gotra.

145
00:18:20,000 --> 00:18:22,000
Para Hutt sangat serius soal keamanan.

146
00:19:13,125 --> 00:19:14,875
Para Hutt telah memimpin bisnis kriminal

147
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:16,500
selama ribuan tahun.

148
00:19:17,375 --> 00:19:18,875
-

149
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:23,000
